## Article 15. Language of proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article15Language:
  input usesStateLanguage content YesNo
  input participantNeedsInterpreter content YesNo
  output languageCompliant content YesNo
  output interpreterRequired content YesNo
  output canUseNativeLanguage content YesNo

scope Article15Language:
  label compliant_default definition languageCompliant equals No

  label state_lang_exception exception compliant_default
  definition languageCompliant under condition
    usesStateLanguage = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label interpreter definition interpreterRequired equals participantNeedsInterpreter

  label native_language definition canUseNativeLanguage equals Yes
```

## Article 16. Legal aid

```catala
declaration scope Article16LegalAid:
  input participantWantsLawyer content YesNo
  input qualifiesForFreeAid content YesNo
  output canUseLawyer content YesNo
  output representationMustBeAdvocate content YesNo
  output freeAidAvailable content YesNo

scope Article16LegalAid:
  definition canUseLawyer equals Yes

  definition representationMustBeAdvocate equals Yes

  label free_aid_exception exception no_free_aid
  definition freeAidAvailable under condition
    qualifiesForFreeAid = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_free_aid definition freeAidAvailable equals No
```

## Article 17. Pre-trial dispute resolution

```catala
declaration scope Article17PreTrialResolution:
  input preTrialRequiredByLaw content YesNo
  input voluntaryAttemptMade content YesNo
  input rightsViolationByOtherParty content YesNo
  output preTrialRequired content YesNo
  output mustRestoreRights content YesNo

scope Article17PreTrialResolution:
  label required_by_law_default definition preTrialRequired equals No

  label required_by_law_exception exception required_by_law_default
  definition preTrialRequired under condition
    preTrialRequiredByLaw = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label must_restore definition mustRestoreRights equals rightsViolationByOtherParty
```

## Article 18. Unified court information and communication system

```catala
declaration scope Article18ElectronicSystem:
  input isAdvocate content YesNo
  input isStateBody content YesNo
  input isLegalEntity content YesNo
  input hasReligiousObjection content YesNo
  input eCabinetRegistered content YesNo
  output mustRegisterECabinet content YesNo
  output documentsServedElectronically content YesNo
  output canStillFilePaper content YesNo
  output automatedCaseAssignment content YesNo

scope Article18ElectronicSystem:
  label must_register_default definition mustRegisterECabinet equals No

  label advocate_must_register exception must_register_default
  definition mustRegisterECabinet under condition
    isAdvocate = Yes and hasReligiousObjection = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label state_body_must_register exception must_register_default
  definition mustRegisterECabinet under condition
    isStateBody = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label legal_entity_must_register exception must_register_default
  definition mustRegisterECabinet under condition
    isLegalEntity = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label electronic_service definition documentsServedElectronically equals eCabinetRegistered

  label paper_allowed definition canStillFilePaper equals Yes

  label automated definition automatedCaseAssignment equals Yes
```
